<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12344"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 28, 2005 - 7:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe the plastic bag was to cover his hand&#40;s&#41;? so as not to leave any fingerprints?  SOunds to me like they are ONE lucky couple!  I also feel this couple should forward their experience to WPD <BR>They need EVERYTHING<!--/Text--></td></tr>
